The figures are for Corvidex at the end of each week, over the last three days of the week, with Folio's figure for the same days in brackets where the gate compares the two.

| Week | Ramp | p95 latency | Zero results | Mobile conversion vs Folio | Desktop conversion vs Folio | Freshness p99 |
